    hemo:1000035 hemo:4000018 ;
    hemo:2000019 true ;
    hemo:9000008 "Calculates the absolute difference between the present value of monetised benefits and the present value of resource costs." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Net present value" ;
    hemo:9000010 "HM Treasury. The Green Book (2026): UK government guidance on appraisal. Updated 5 February 2026. Chapter 6 Shortlist appraisal, table 10 Summary metrics of social value, which defines net present social value as PVB minus PVC. https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/the-green-book-appraisal-and-evaluation-in-central-government/the-green-book-2026" ;
    hemo:9000011 "Treating positive NPV as an adoption decision. A positive net present value indicates positive monetised net social value under the stated assumptions but does not establish affordability or require adoption." ;
    hemo:9000014 "NPV = PV_B - PV_C" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-FM-CBA-001" ;
