    hemo:9000010 "HM Treasury. The Green Book (2026): UK government guidance on appraisal. Updated 5 February 2026. Chapter 6 Shortlist appraisal, table 10 Summary metrics of social value, which defines the benefit-cost ratio as PVB divided by PVC. https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/the-green-book-appraisal-and-evaluation-in-central-government/the-green-book-2026" ;
