    hemo:1000035 hemo:4000018 ;
    hemo:2000019 false ;
    hemo:9000008 "Adds the mutually exclusive cost categories included under the stated study perspective and boundary." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Total economic burden by category" ;
    hemo:9000010 "Jo C. Cost-of-illness studies: concepts, scopes, and methods. Clinical and Molecular Hepatology. 2014;20(4):327-337. https://doi.org/10.3350/cmh.2014.20.4.327" ;
    hemo:9000011 "Treating economic burden as recoverable savings. The total burden is a valuation of associated resources and losses and does not show how much cash an intervention could release." ;
