    hemo:2000008 0.0005 ;
    hemo:9000008 "With EQ-5D-5L norms the same population has 12.69 general-population QALYs, giving an absolute shortfall of about 6.66 and a proportional shortfall of about 0.52, as in section 5.2 of TSD 23. The weight remains 1." ;
    hemo:9000009 "DSU hypothetical case with EQ-5D-5L norms" ;
    hemo:9000014 "Q_h = 12.69; Q_c = 6.031; AS = 6.659; PS = 0.525" ;
