    hemo:1000036 hemo:4000007 ;
    hemo:9000008 "In the Community Rating article's pool the premium is £2,000 and a low-risk member is expected to cost £1,000, so an insurer expects a profit of £1,000 on that member, the same figure as the cross-subsidy in HE-FM-CRAT-002." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Expected profit on a low-risk member under community rating" ;
