    rheo:2000001 19.212700000000002 .

hemo:7003437 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000017 ;
    rdfs:label "First yearly amount falls at the start of the analysis"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:9000008 "The first amount arises in year 0 and carries a factor of 1, and the last arises in year T minus 1. A model that starts the stream later shifts every factor and needs the general stream sum of HE-FM-DR-002." ;
    hemo:9000009 "First yearly amount falls at the start of the analysis" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-AS-DISC-004" ;
    hemo:9000023 "first-yearly-amount-falls-at-the-start-of-the-analysis" .

hemo:7003438 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000017 ;
    rdfs:label "Constant annual rate for a start-of-year discounted stream"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:9000008 "One rate r applies to every year of the stream, with amounts in constant prices when they are costs." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Constant annual rate for a start-of-year discounted stream" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-AS-DISC-005" ;
    hemo:9000023 "constant-annual-rate-for-a-start-of-year-discounted-stream" .

hemo:7003439 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000014 ;
    rdfs:label "Start-of-year discounted level stream with Excel PV"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:1000004 hemo:5000619 ;
    hemo:1000040 hemo:4000019 ;
    hemo:9000008 "The fifth argument of PV set to 1 places each amount at the start of its period. The second formula is the same closed form written out." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Start-of-year discounted level stream with Excel PV" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-IM-DISC-002" ;
    hemo:9000023 "start-of-year-discounted-level-stream-with-excel-pv" ;
    hemo:9000024 "=PV(DiscRate,Years,-YearlyAmount,0,1); =YearlyAmount*(1+DiscRate)*(1-(1+DiscRate)^-Years)/DiscRate" .

hemo:7003440 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000015 ;
    rdfs:label "Start-of-year total equals the end-of-year total times one plus the rate"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:1000036 hemo:4000010 ;
    hemo:9000008 "With the two totals in StartTotal and EndTotal for the same amount, rate and number of years, the start-of-year total is (1 + r) times the end-of-year total. The expected result is TRUE." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Start-of-year total equals the end-of-year total times one plus the rate" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-VT-DISC-003" ;
    hemo:9000023 "start-of-year-total-equals-the-end-of-year-total-times-one-plus-the-rate" ;
    hemo:9000024 "=ABS(StartTotal-(1+DiscRate)*EndTotal)<1E-9" .

hemo:7003441 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000015 ;
    rdfs:label "Larson's start-of-year discounted value reproduced"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:1000036 hemo:4000010 ;
    hemo:9000008 "PV with the start-of-period flag, a rate of 3% and ten amounts of 1 returns 8.786 to three decimal places, as in Larson's Table 1. The expected result is TRUE. FALSE shows the flag left at 0, which gives about 8.530." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Larson's start-of-year discounted value reproduced" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-VT-DISC-004" ;
    hemo:9000023 "larson-s-start-of-year-discounted-value-reproduced" ;
    hemo:9000024 "=ABS(PV(0.03,10,-1,0,1)-8.786)<0.0005" .

hemo:7003442 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000015 ;
    rdfs:label "Green Book benefit of GBP 1,000 in real terms from year 0 to year 5"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:1000036 hemo:4000007 ;
    hemo:1000037 hemo:7003443,
        hemo:7003444,
        hemo:7003445 ;
    hemo:1000038 hemo:7003446 ;
    hemo:2000008 0.005 ;
    hemo:9000008 "The Green Book's Table 8 applies its factors of 1, 0.9662, 0.9335, 0.9019, 0.8714 and 0.8420 to social benefits constant at GBP 1,000 in real terms in years 0 to 5. The six amounts are worth about GBP 5,515 in present value terms at 3.5% (computed here for illustration from the formula)." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Green Book benefit of GBP 1,000 in real terms from year 0 to year 5" ;
    hemo:9000014 "q = 1000; r = 0.035; T = 6; Q_s = 5515.05" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-EX-DISC-003" ;
    hemo:9000023 "green-book-benefit-of-gbp-1-000-in-real-terms-from-year-0-to-year-5" .

