hemo:7003474 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000017 ;
    rdfs:label "Whole incremental cost of the one-off treatment in year 0"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:9000008 "All extra cost falls at the start, so its factor is 1. Later costs, such as monitoring, would need their own discounted total in the numerator." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Whole incremental cost of the one-off treatment in year 0" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-AS-DISC-008" ;
    hemo:9000023 "whole-incremental-cost-of-the-one-off-treatment-in-year-0" .

hemo:7003475 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000017 ;
    rdfs:label "Same rate for the cost and the QALYs of a one-off treatment"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:9000008 "Costs and QALYs share one rate, 3.5% a year in the NICE reference case. A 1.5% rate is a non-reference-case analysis that the committee may consider only when all the criteria in section 4.5.3 of PMG36 are met." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Same rate for the cost and the QALYs of a one-off treatment" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-AS-DISC-009" ;
    hemo:9000023 "same-rate-for-the-cost-and-the-qalys-of-a-one-off-treatment" .

hemo:7003476 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000014 ;
    rdfs:label "Discounted cost per QALY of a one-off treatment in one cell"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:1000004 hemo:5000621 ;
    hemo:1000040 hemo:4000019 ;
    hemo:9000008 "With the cost in OneOffCost, the yearly gain in YearlyQALYs, the rate in DiscRate and the years in Years, the cell divides the undiscounted cost by the discounted QALYs from PV." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Discounted cost per QALY of a one-off treatment in one cell" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-IM-DISC-004" ;
    hemo:9000023 "discounted-cost-per-qaly-of-a-one-off-treatment-in-one-cell" ;
    hemo:9000024 "=OneOffCost/PV(DiscRate,Years,-YearlyQALYs)" .

hemo:7003477 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000015 ;
    rdfs:label "Rise in a one-off treatment ratio at 3.5 per cent over 30 years"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:1000036 hemo:4000010 ;
    hemo:9000008 "For any positive cost and gain, the discounted ratio at 3.5% over 30 years is about 1.6311 times the undiscounted ratio, the rise of about 63% in the article. The expected result is TRUE." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Rise in a one-off treatment ratio at 3.5 per cent over 30 years" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-VT-DISC-007" ;
    hemo:9000023 "rise-in-a-one-off-treatment-ratio-at-3-5-per-cent-over-30-years" ;
    hemo:9000024 "=ABS(OneOffCost/PV(0.035,30,-YearlyQALYs)/(OneOffCost/(YearlyQALYs*30))-1.6311)<0.0001" .

hemo:7003478 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000015 ;
    rdfs:label "Article's one-off treatment discounted at 3.5 per cent"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:1000036 hemo:4000007 ;
    hemo:1000037 hemo:7003479,
        hemo:7003480,
        hemo:7003481,
        hemo:7003482 ;
    hemo:1000038 hemo:7003483 ;
    hemo:2000008 0.005 ;
    hemo:9000008 "GBP 300,000 at the start and 0.8 QALYs a year for 30 years give about GBP 20,389 per QALY at 3.5%, GBP 20,400 to the nearest GBP 100 in the article, against GBP 12,500 undiscounted." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Article's one-off treatment discounted at 3.5 per cent" ;
    hemo:9000014 "C_0 = 300000; q = 0.8; r = 0.035; T = 30; ICER = 20389.25" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-EX-DISC-008" ;
    hemo:9000023 "article-s-one-off-treatment-discounted-at-3-5-per-cent" .

hemo:7003479 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000016 ;
    rdfs:label "C_0 in the test Article's one-off treatment discounted at 3.5 per cent"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:1000039 hemo:6002635 ;
    rheo:2000001 300000.0 .

