    hemo:9000008 "With an illustrative 2,000 patients a year for five years, the 10,000 future patients of the article's example, and an illustrative discount rate of 3.5% a year, D is about 4.6731 and the GBP 73 per-patient EVSI of S1 gives a population EVSI of about GBP 682,270." ;
