    hemo:2000008 0.00005 ;
    hemo:9000008 "Before the first step the later rates have no effect and the factor is 1.035 to the power minus 20, 0.5026, the year-20 value of Table A.1 and the weight the article gives a QALY in year 20 at 3.5%, a limiting case that checks an implementation." ;
