    hemo:9000008 "Applies a disease-attributable fraction to compatible aggregate expenditure." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Top-down attributable burden" ;
    hemo:9000010 "Jo C. Cost-of-illness studies: concepts, scopes, and methods. Clinical and Molecular Hepatology. 2014;20(4):327-337. https://doi.org/10.3350/cmh.2014.20.4.327" ;
    hemo:9000011 "Applying an incompatible attributable fraction. Using a fraction from a different population, period or expenditure category can misattribute aggregate spending to the condition." ;
