    obo:IAO_0000115 "Gives the incremental net health benefit of an option with its QALY gain weighted by a decision modifier, such as a severity weight, at a stated money value of a QALY, as NICE asks for at GBP 25,000 and GBP 35,000 per QALY with and without the weighting."@en ;
