    hemo:9000008 "Adds periodic budget impacts across the complete planning horizon." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Cumulative budget impact" ;
    hemo:9000010 "Sullivan SD, Mauskopf JA, Augustovski F, Jaime Caro J, Lee KM, Minchin M, et al. Budget impact analysis: principles of good practice. Report of the ISPOR 2012 Budget Impact Analysis Good Practice II Task Force. Value in Health. 2014;17(1):5-14. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jval.2013.08.2291" ;
    hemo:9000011 "Discounting away the annual cash-flow view. Replacing undiscounted period-specific expenditure with a single discounted total can obscure the amounts the budget holder expects to pay in each financial period." ;
