    hemo:1000009 hemo:7005646 ;
    hemo:1000010 hemo:7007101,
        hemo:7007102,
        hemo:7007103,
        hemo:7007104,
        hemo:7007105 ;
    hemo:1000035 hemo:4000018 ;
    hemo:2000019 true ;
    hemo:9000008 "Takes an EQ-5D-3L profile, as a five-digit string such as 11223 or as five level inputs, and a coefficient set of the main-effects form, and returns the utility with the two indicators D and N3. It applies HE-FM-EQ3L-001 with level 2 and level 3 dummies built from the levels, so any value set tabulated with a constant, ten level dummies and N3 can be scored, and with the UK coefficients it reproduces HE-FM-EQ3L-002. The R and Python versions also score all 243 states." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Computational function for scoring an EQ-5D-3L profile under any constant and N3 coefficient set" ;
    hemo:9000010 "Janssen B, Szende A, Ramos-Goñi JM. Data and methods. In Szende A, Janssen B, Cabases J, editors. Self-reported population health. An international perspective based on EQ-5D. Dordrecht, Springer, 2014, chapter 2. Table 2.2, which tabulates national time trade-off coefficients as a constant, level 2 and level 3 dummies for each dimension and N3, including the UK and Dutch rows used here. The UK coefficients agree with Table 1 of Dolan, Gudex, Kind and Williams 1995. https://doi.org/10.1007/978-94-007-7596-1_2" ;
    hemo:9000011 "Printed negative signs kept in a subtracting formula. Entering the EuroQol reference volume's negative coefficients into a formula that subtracts them turns every decrement into a gain, so 11223 scores 1.745 instead of 0.255. The signs are dropped, or the coefficients are added to 1 as printed" ;
    hemo:9000014 "D = min(l_MO + l_SC + l_UA + l_PD + l_AD - 5, 1); N_3 = min(max(l_MO - 2, 0) + max(l_SC - 2, 0) + max(l_UA - 2, 0) + max(l_PD - 2, 0) + max(l_AD - 2, 0), 1); U = 1 - c_0 * D - b_MO2 * (min(l_MO - 1, 1) - max(l_MO - 2, 0)) - b_MO3 * max(l_MO - 2, 0) - b_SC2 * (min(l_SC - 1, 1) - max(l_SC - 2, 0)) - b_SC3 * max(l_SC - 2, 0) - b_UA2 * (min(l_UA - 1, 1) - max(l_UA - 2, 0)) - b_UA3 * max(l_UA - 2, 0) - b_PD2 * (min(l_PD - 1, 1) - max(l_PD - 2, 0)) - b_PD3 * max(l_PD - 2, 0) - b_AD2 * (min(l_AD - 1, 1) - max(l_AD - 2, 0)) - b_AD3 * max(l_AD - 2, 0) - c_N3 * N_3" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-CF-EQ3L-001" ;
    hemo:9000023 "computational-function-for-scoring-an-eq-5d-3l-profile-under-any-constant-and-n3-coefficient-set" .

