        hemo:7007197,
        hemo:7007198,
        hemo:7007199 ;
    hemo:1000035 hemo:4000018 ;
    hemo:2000019 true ;
    hemo:9000008 "Takes the prices and exchange rates of any number of basket countries, a flag for whether each country has an observed price, a ceiling multiplier and a proposed domestic price, and returns the number of priced countries, their mean, median, lowest and highest converted price, the ceiling of HE-FM-BOC-004 and the margin of the proposed price over it. Countries without a price drop out of every aggregate, which is how the article's launch-sequencing case raises the ceiling. The calculator line covers five countries and the mean; the R and Python code take any number of countries and also return the median. The inputs therefore differ from the formula's variables, which assume five priced countries." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Computational function for a basket reference price and ceiling with countries that have no price" ;
    hemo:9000010 "Rémuzat C, Urbinati D, Mzoughi O, El Hammi E, Belgaied W, Toumi M. Overview of external reference pricing systems in Europe. Journal of Market Access and Health Policy. 2015;3:27675. Section Potential consequences of ERP, subsection Patient access to medicines, on launch sequence strategies used to delay or avoid launching new drugs in countries with potentially lower prices. Kanavos P, Fontrier AM, Gill J, Efthymiadou O. Does external reference pricing deliver what it promises? Evidence on its impact at national level. European Journal of Health Economics. 2020;21(1):129-151. Introduction, on the lowest price, the average and the median as reference-price rules." ;
    hemo:9000011 "Launch order ignored when comparing ceilings. Taking Basket B's ceiling as 113.75 while the country priced at 70 has not launched understates it by 6.5625, against 120.3125, and puts the margin of the proposed price of 130 at 16.25 instead of 9.6875, the effect of launch order that the article describes" ;
    hemo:9000014 "n = d_1 + d_2 + d_3 + d_4 + d_5; P_mean = (d_1 * c_1 + d_2 * c_2 + d_3 * c_3 + d_4 * c_4 + d_5 * c_5) / n; T = k * P_mean; D = P_prop - T" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-CF-BOC-002" ;
    hemo:9000023 "computational-function-for-a-basket-reference-price-and-ceiling-with-countries-that-have-no-price" .

