        hemo:6004042,
        hemo:6005013,
        hemo:6005014,
        hemo:6005015 ;
    hemo:1000008 hemo:6004043,
        hemo:6004044,
        hemo:6004045,
        hemo:6004046,
        hemo:6005016 ;
    hemo:1000009 hemo:7005869 ;
    hemo:1000010 hemo:7007224,
        hemo:7007225,
        hemo:7007226,
        hemo:7007227,
        hemo:7007228,
        hemo:7007229 ;
    hemo:1000035 hemo:4000018 ;
    hemo:2000019 true ;
    hemo:9000008 "Scores one EQ-5D-3L profile under two national value sets of the constant and N3 form, the UK MVH tariff of HE-FM-EQ3L-002 and the Zimbabwe set of Jelsma and colleagues, and returns both utilities and their difference. The R and Python versions score all 243 states under both sets and count the ordered pairs of states for which the two sets disagree on the direction of the change, the cross-set reversal that HE-FM-CSVS-001 splits by term for one pair. Any other pair of constant and N3 sets can be compared by replacing the two coefficient dictionaries." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Computational function for comparing the UK MVH and Zimbabwe EQ-5D-3L value sets state by state" ;
    hemo:9000010 "Jelsma J, Hansen K, De Weerdt W, De Cock P, Kind P. How do Zimbabweans value health states? Population Health Metrics. 2003;1(1):11. Results, Valuations subsection, Table 5 and the worked value for 22331. The UK coefficients are those of HE-FM-EQ3L-002, from Table 1 of Dolan, Gudex, Kind and Williams 1995. https://doi.org/10.1186/1478-7954-1-11" ;
    hemo:9000011 "Reading the mean gap as a uniform shift. Over all 243 states the UK value is lower in 235, higher in 7 and equal only at 11111, with a mean difference of minus 0.314, a minimum of minus 0.519 at 32133 and a maximum of plus 0.026 at 11211. Of the 58,806 ordered pairs of distinct states, 4,116, or 7.0%, change direction between the two sets (computed here with the code above), so a single offset between two national sets cannot stand in for rescoring" ;
    hemo:9000014 "D = min(l_MO + l_SC + l_UA + l_PD + l_AD - 5, 1); N_3 = min(max(l_MO - 2, 0) + max(l_SC - 2, 0) + max(l_UA - 2, 0) + max(l_PD - 2, 0) + max(l_AD - 2, 0), 1); U_UK = 1 - 0.081 * D - 0.069 * (min(l_MO - 1, 1) - max(l_MO - 2, 0)) - 0.314 * max(l_MO - 2, 0) - 0.104 * (min(l_SC - 1, 1) - max(l_SC - 2, 0)) - 0.214 * max(l_SC - 2, 0) - 0.036 * (min(l_UA - 1, 1) - max(l_UA - 2, 0)) - 0.094 * max(l_UA - 2, 0) - 0.123 * (min(l_PD - 1, 1) - max(l_PD - 2, 0)) - 0.386 * max(l_PD - 2, 0) - 0.071 * (min(l_AD - 1, 1) - max(l_AD - 2, 0)) - 0.236 * max(l_AD - 2, 0) - 0.269 * N_3; U_ZW = 1 - 0.1 * D - 0.056 * (min(l_MO - 1, 1) - max(l_MO - 2, 0)) - 0.204 * max(l_MO - 2, 0) - 0.092 * (min(l_SC - 1, 1) - max(l_SC - 2, 0)) - 0.231 * max(l_SC - 2, 0) - 0.043 * (min(l_UA - 1, 1) - max(l_UA - 2, 0)) - 0.135 * max(l_UA - 2, 0) - 0.067 * (min(l_PD - 1, 1) - max(l_PD - 2, 0)) - 0.302 * max(l_PD - 2, 0) - 0.046 * (min(l_AD - 1, 1) - max(l_AD - 2, 0)) - 0.173 * max(l_AD - 2, 0); dU = U_UK - U_ZW" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-CF-CSVS-001" ;
    hemo:9000023 "computational-function-for-comparing-the-uk-mvh-and-zimbabwe-eq-5d-3l-value-sets-state-by-state" .

