    hemo:1000035 hemo:4000018 ;
    hemo:2000019 true ;
    hemo:9000008 "Maps an accountable care organisation's per capita benchmark, its assigned beneficiaries' per capita Medicare Parts A and B spending for the performance year and the parameters of its track to the shared savings payment CMS makes to it or the shared losses it repays, as set in 42 CFR 425.605 for the BASIC track and 425.610 for the ENHANCED track. HE-FM-ACO-001 gives the shared savings payment, gated by the minimum savings rate and capped by the performance payment limit, HE-FM-ACO-002 the shared losses of a two-sided BASIC level with its minimum loss rate and loss recoupment limit, and HE-FM-ACO-003 the shared losses of the ENHANCED track, whose loss rate falls as the quality score rises. Each settlement is gated, so the amount jumps from zero once the gap between spending and benchmark reaches the minimum rate and is then shared from the first dollar. This differs from a deductible layer such as the aggregate stop-loss payment HE-FM-ASL-001 (claims above an attachment point, capped at a maximum), the mean and variance of specific stop-loss reimbursement over a claims distribution HE-FM-ATTP-001 or the medical loss ratio rebate HE-FM-ACR-004 (the shortfall of the ratio below the standard times adjusted premium, floored at zero), all continuous in their claims or ratio argument. Only the final min step, a cap on the shared amount, takes the form of HE-FM-ASL-001 with no attachment point. The fee-for-service payments that continue underneath the settlement are not modelled, the per case blend of a fixed amount and a cost share is HE-FM-CTH-001, the margin reading of shared savings as a blend belongs to the blended-payment concept, and the expected profit per member that drives selection, payment minus expected cost, is HE-FM-CSKM-001. Notation follows the Accountable Care Organization article." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Medicare Shared Savings Program annual settlement of an accountable care organisation" ;
    hemo:9000014 "v(B, E, N, s, q, MSR, c_P, r_L, MLR, rho_R, Rev, rho_B, Q) = (P, SL, SL_E)" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-FN-ACO-001" ;
    hemo:9000023 "medicare-shared-savings-program-annual-settlement-of-an-accountable-care-organisation" .

