hemo:5000048 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000012 ;
    rdfs:label "Inverse-variance pooling of aggregate study-level effect estimates"@en ;
    dcterms:identifier "HE-FN-ADMA-001" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:1000035 hemo:4000018 ;
    hemo:2000019 false ;
    hemo:9000008 "Maps the effect estimate and its variance from each of k studies to one pooled estimate, its standard error and measures of between-study heterogeneity. Each study is weighted by the inverse of the variance of its estimate, so more precise studies count for more. Under a common-effect model the weight uses the within-study variance alone; under a random-effects model it also includes the between-study variance tau2. In health technology assessment the pooled relative effect, usually a log hazard ratio or log odds ratio, is then applied to a baseline from another source in a decision model." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Inverse-variance pooling of aggregate study-level effect estimates" ;
    hemo:9000014 "theta_hat = sum_(i=1)^k [w_i * y_i] / sum_(i=1)^k [w_i]" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-FN-ADMA-001" ;
    hemo:9000023 "inverse-variance-pooling-of-aggregate-study-level-effect-estimates" .

hemo:5000050 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000012 ;
    rdfs:label "Average length of stay calculation and bed-day costing function"@en ;
    dcterms:identifier "HE-FN-ALOS-001" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
    hemo:1000035 hemo:4000018 ;
    hemo:2000019 false ;
    hemo:9000008 "Maps the bed-days and discharges of a period to the average length of stay (ALOS), and relates length of stay to bed capacity, payment trim points, a case-mix adjusted comparison and the cost of an admission or of a change in stay. The records follow the notation of the Average Length of Stay article, where L_bar is the average stay in days and N the number of discharges." ;
    hemo:9000009 "Average length of stay calculation and bed-day costing function" ;
    hemo:9000014 "L_bar = f(BD, N); D = g(B, o, L_bar); T = h(Q_1, Q_3); R_h = O_h / E_h; C = k(L_bar, c)" ;
    hemo:9000018 "HE-FN-ALOS-001" ;
    hemo:9000023 "average-length-of-stay-calculation-and-bed-day-costing-function" .

hemo:5000175 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        hemo:0000010 ;
    rdfs:label "Time-homogeneous cohort state update"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "the Source rows of the Functions and Formulae module record HE-FM-MM-001" ;
    dcterms:identifier "HE-FM-MM-001" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/hemo-formulae.owl> ;
